{"id":"n62327-2-9","stage":3,"title":"넘치다 · 泛滥","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62327-2-9-1","ko":"이 정도 음식이면 충분하겠지?","zh":"这些菜够了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도","meaning":"程度，限度","explanation":"정도：程度，限度","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"2","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식이면","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"충분하겠지?","meaning":"充分，充足，足够","explanation":"충분하다：充分，充足，足够；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"충분하다","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72147","senseId":"1","lemma":"충분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度，限度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"不能超过的一定水准；或指适当的限度。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"0e3ccf834eaa673e","term":"충분하다","zh":"充分，充足，足够","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3","entryId":"72147","definition":"不欠缺，十分充裕。","pronunciation":["충분하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa76dd0b93b8a0eaa9ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62327-2-9-2","ko":"충분해. 넘치면 몰라도 모자라지는 않을 거야.","zh":"够了，只可能多，不会少。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"충분해.","meaning":"充分，充足，足够","explanation":"충분하다：充分，充足，足够；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"충분하다","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72147","senseId":"1","lemma":"충분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘치면","meaning":"泛滥，满溢","explanation":"넘치다：泛滥，满溢；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"넘치다","audio":"/audio/c2c9d694bbc93632e381.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62327","senseId":"2","lemma":"넘치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰라도","meaning":"不管了，管不了","explanation":"모르다：不管了，管不了；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"7","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모자라지는","meaning":"不够，不足","explanation":"모자라다：不够，不足；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모자라다","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46143","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않을","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0e3ccf834eaa673e","term":"충분하다","zh":"充分，充足，足够","audio":"/audio/0e3ccf834eaa673e455d.mp3","entryId":"72147","definition":"不欠缺，十分充裕。","pronunciation":["충분하다"]},{"id":"c2c9d694bbc93632","term":"넘치다","zh":"泛滥，满溢","audio":"/audio/c2c9d694bbc93632e381.mp3","entryId":"62327","definition":"某个东西太多。","pronunciation":["넘ː치다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不管了，管不了","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"没有关系。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"05ceb5dfc162d026","term":"모자라다","zh":"不够，不足","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3","entryId":"46143","definition":"达不到规定的数量或程度。","pronunciation":["모ː자라다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/420c08d8e6426f2f5704.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.856,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62327","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.5094,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这些菜够了吧？","够了，只可能多，不会少。","桌子上面为什么堆了那么多书啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这些菜够了吧？","够了，只可能多，不会少。","桌子上面为什么堆了那么多书啊？"],"answer":1}]}
